dialogs
4	Hoo, boy… Master Rank CONTESTS, here I come.The world will know that my dearest POKéMON is the cutest being in all existence. The time has come! Uheheheh.
5	You can see a whole variety of POKéMON here.That's why I make this place a regular part of my daily stroll.
6	Wow, coming out to a CONTEST is a feast for these eyes!Would you look at all the POKéMON that just scream to be painted?
11	Day in and day out, I lavished my care on this POKéMON.Its condition is peaking. Today, victory is mine!
12	The TOUGHNESS CONTEST is like extreme, man!Those muscular appeals… Cascading sweat… I swoon!
13	I made S with Mom, Dad, and Big Sister. They turned out great!I bet you can make smoother, better S if you have more people.
24	Yippee!The lady at the reception counter gave me a case for S!
