goto LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_EventScript_FaceOriginalDirection
end
= LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_EventScript_BlendMasterOnlooker5
lock
faceplayer
msgbox	Eyes that track the arrow with machinelike intensity…A hand that taps the A Button with clockwork-like precision…Possessing these qualities makes the BLEND MASTER truly great.
goto LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_EventScript_FaceOriginalDirection
end
