= LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_EventScript_SubmitResponse
setvar VAR_0x8004 24
special SetContestCategoryStringVarForInterview
msgbox	Ah, I see. That's a very edifying comment.You get a good feel for what the CONTEST was like.I've got one last question.When you hear the word “,” what image do you get?
setvar VAR_0x8004 EASY_CHAT_TYPE_CONTEST_INTERVIEW
copyvar VAR_0x8005 VAR_0x8009
setvar VAR_0x8006 1
call Common_ShowEasyChatScreen
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT 0 LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_EventScript_DeclineInterview
msgbox	I see!So that's how you imagine the concept of “” to be.Thank you! You've given me some good ideas.I think I can write a good story on POKéMON CONTESTS now.Maybe, just maybe, this story will even make it to television. I hope you'll look forward to it!
setflag FLAG_TEMP_2
setvar VAR_0x8005 TVSHOW_BRAVO_TRAINER_POKEMON_PROFILE
goto Interview_EventScript_EndInterview
end
= Interview_EventScript_EndInterview
special InterviewAfter
incrementgamestat GAME_STAT_GOT_INTERVIEWED
release
end
